s.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_LOW_Keg'sHaunt_LetsMeetLetter</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_Keg%27sHaunt_LetsMeetLetter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_Keg%27sHaunt_LetsMeetLetter\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">fb6a8510-c444-4056-a0b7-336cd36f400c</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:fb6a8510-c444-4056-a0b7-336cd36f400c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:fb6a8510-c444-4056-a0b7-336cd36f400c\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In a mailbox of the house next to the <a href=\"/wiki/Basilisk_Gate_Barracks\" title=\"Basilisk Gate Barracks\">Basilisk Gate Barracks</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City\" title=\"Lower City\">Lower City</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;123&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-2</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[A hastily scrawled note.]<br><br>\nI have the information you wanted. You were right, the <a href=\"/wiki/Bhaal_Temple\" title=\"Bhaal Temple\">Temple</a> membership is growing. I'll tell you all about their so-called <a href=\"/wiki/Murder_Tribunal\" title=\"Murder Tribunal\">Tribunal</a>. Meet me tomorrow, you know where.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714213204\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.046 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.049 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1355/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 23337/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5409/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936167/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   38.899      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   38.899      1 -total\n 50.00%   19.451      6 Template:Icon_text\n 44.43%   17.285     15 Template:Trim\n 24.36%    9.475      2 Template:Uid\n 17.65%    6.865      1 Template:Main_only\n 14.25%    5.543      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.38%    4.039      1 Template:Notes\n  9.72%    3.782      1 Template:Icon_link\n  9.60%    3.733      6 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:32494-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714213204 and revision id 327076. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}